{"id":"97b68cd750e79cac","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-solovay-realization.md","title":"Solovay Realization","display":"df-solovay-realization — Solovay Realization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-solovay-realization","aliases":["89-df-solovay-realization"],"display":"df-solovay-realization — Solovay Realization","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-df-function]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-solovay-realization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-solovay-realization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-solovay-realization — Solovay Realization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55612987d4585fa4\" href=\"?note=55612987d4585fa4\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation\">89-df-arithmetical-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0d71e87a2f416230\" href=\"?note=0d71e87a2f416230\" title=\"89-df-function\">89-df-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\)</span> 是有限模型，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:n\\to W\">\\(e:n\\to W\\)</span> 为指定双射。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L:W\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(L:W\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 是指定句族。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\langle\\rangle=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\langle\\rangle=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}(s{}^\\frown\\langle B\\rangle)=(\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}s)\\lor B\">\\(\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}(s{}^\\frown\\langle B\\rangle)=(\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}s)\\lor B\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 为已有 PA 结构实现集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathrm{PA},r}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathrm{PA},r}\\)</span> 为实现赋值的结构扩张。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KModel}(W,R,V)\">\\(\\mathrm{KModel}(W,R,V)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 仍使用原来的以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 开始的左折叠，不删去这一首项。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nr_\\sigma(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\langle L(e((I_p)_j))\\mid j&lt;|I_p|\\rangle\\quad(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\n\\tau_\\sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau_{\\mathrm{PA},r_\\sigma}\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nr_\\sigma(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\langle L(e((I_p)_j))\\mid j&lt;|I_p|\\rangle\\quad(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\n\\tau_\\sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau_{\\mathrm{PA},r_\\sigma}\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nI_p&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{inc}(\\{i&lt;n\\mid e(i)\\in V(p)\\}),\\\\\n\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\langle\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\quad\n\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}(s\\frown\\langle B\\rangle)\\coloneqq\n(\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}s)\\lor B\n\\quad(s\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{&lt;\\omega},\\ B\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nI_p&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{inc}(\\{i&lt;n\\mid e(i)\\in V(p)\\}),\\\\\n\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\langle\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\quad\n\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}(s\\frown\\langle B\\rangle)\\coloneqq\n(\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}s)\\lor B\n\\quad(s\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{&lt;\\omega},\\ B\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 9 章，印刷页 127–130；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n有限析取按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 的指标递增取序列；空赋值集送到矛盾句。此定义允许任意句族，因此“构造了实现”与“证明实现忠实”是两个步骤；忠实性需使用自指构造和极限句性质。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"1f581262c09d5e34","an